WEBVTT

00:00:07.622 --> 00:00:09.952
<v><b>A:</b></v> Good afternoon. How can I help you?

00:00:10.448 --> 00:00:13.840
<v><b>B:</b></v> Hello. I have a reservation for two nights.

00:00:14.089 --> 00:00:14.713
<v><b>A:</b></v> Your name?

00:00:15.156 --> 00:00:15.790
<v><b>B:</b></v> Carter.

00:00:16.155 --> 00:00:17.970
<v><b>A:</b></v> Carter. Here we are.

00:00:18.402 --> 00:00:19.723
Can you sign here, please?

00:00:20.390 --> 00:00:24.857
Here’s your key card. You’re in room 212, on the second floor.